additional_context = "Use the NEH heuristic (provided in solver_lib:neh) to generate a high-quality job sequence instead of brute-force permutations. NEH is a greedy insertion method known to produce good solutions quickly for flow-shop scheduling. Start with the sum-of-processing-times sort, then iteratively insert each job into the best position of the current partial sequence using the makespan evaluation from the lower layer's C-matrix logic."